This might be your problem: If you put a bag of tricks, bag of
holding, or wand of cancellation into a bag of holding, the bag will
explode, and everything in it will be lost. Could you have done this?

(This is a good reason not to put any unidentified bags or wands into
a bag of holding until you know what the dangerous items look like.)
